`touches: memory/projects/mr-gates`

Prose that mentions shall in lowercase and should not count.

EARS: WHEN a slice PR opens, THE SYSTEM SHALL append one residual record per named follow-up.
`mr-ready` SHALL surface unclaimed records. No record SHALL block a merge.
Tests: proof-of-teeth — three synthetic records (ADR-0010).

